<%- include('partials/head') %><%- include('partials/topbar') %>
<main class="content settings-page"><div class="settings-head"><div><span class="settings-kicker">ACCOUNT & CREATOR</span><h1>Akkaunt markazi</h1><p class="muted">For You qiziqishlari, Creator Mode, push va ma’lumot nazorati.</p></div><a class="btn ghost" href="/settings"><i data-lucide="settings-2"></i> Asosiy sozlamalar</a></div><%if(saved){%><div class="success-alert"><i data-lucide="check-circle-2"></i> Saqlandi.</div><%}%>
<form class="settings-grid" method="post" action="/account/preferences"><section class="card settings-card"><div class="settings-card-title"><span><i data-lucide="sparkles"></i></span><div><h2>For You qiziqishlari</h2><p>Cold-start feed uchun ochiq, sezgir bo‘lmagan mavzular</p></div></div><div class="interest-grid"><%options.forEach(o=>{%><label class="interest-chip"><input type="checkbox" name="interests" value="<%=o.key%>" <%=(me.interests||[]).includes(o.key)?'checked':''%>><span><i data-lucide="sparkles"></i><%=o.label%></span></label><%})%></div><p class="muted tiny">Maksimum 8 ta. Lumi sog‘liq, din, siyosiy qarash kabi sezgir xususiyatlarni bu funksiyada infer qilmaydi.</p></section>
<section class="card settings-card"><div class="settings-card-title"><span><i data-lucide="badge-check"></i></span><div><h2>Creator Mode</h2><p>Profilingizni creator sifatida ko‘rsatish va analytics vositalarini ajratish</p></div></div><label class="setting-switch"><span><b>Creator Mode</b><small>Bu verification badge emas va maxsus admin huquqi bermaydi.</small></span><input type="checkbox" name="creatorMode" <%=me.creatorMode?'checked':''%>><i></i></label><label>Creator yo‘nalishi<select name="creatorCategory"><option value="">Tanlang</option><%categories.forEach(c=>{%><option value="<%=c.key%>" <%=me.creatorCategory===c.key?'selected':''%>><%=c.label%></option><%})%></select></label><a class="btn ghost full" href="/creator/analytics"><i data-lucide="chart-no-axes-combined"></i> Creator Analytics</a></section><div class="settings-save"><button class="btn primary"><i data-lucide="save"></i> Saqlash</button></div></form>
<div class="settings-grid lower-settings"><section class="card settings-card"><div class="settings-card-title"><span><i data-lucide="bell-ring"></i></span><div><h2>Push notification</h2><p>Brauzer/PWA uchun web push</p></div></div><button type="button" class="btn ghost full" data-push-enable><i data-lucide="bell-plus"></i> Push notificationni yoqish</button><p class="muted tiny">Android Play buildining native push qismi review davomida o‘zgartirilmaydi; bu web/PWA push.</p></section>
<section class="card settings-card"><div class="settings-card-title"><span><i data-lucide="database"></i></span><div><h2>Ma’lumotlaringiz</h2><p>Eksport va maxfiylik nazorati</p></div></div><div class="settings-data-actions"><a class="btn ghost full" href="/settings/export"><i data-lucide="download"></i> Ma’lumotlarimni JSON eksport qilish</a><a class="btn ghost full" href="/privacy"><i data-lucide="shield-check"></i> Privacy Policy</a><a class="btn ghost full" href="/terms"><i data-lucide="scroll-text"></i> Foydalanish shartlari</a></div></section>
<section class="card settings-card danger-zone"><div class="settings-card-title"><span><i data-lucide="trash-2"></i></span><div><h2>Akkauntni o‘chirish</h2><p>Google Play talabiga mos ravishda akkaunt va bog‘liq live ma’lumotlarni o‘chirish yo‘li</p></div></div><a class="btn danger full" href="/account-deletion"><i data-lucide="trash-2"></i> Akkaunt va ma’lumotlarni o‘chirish</a><p class="muted tiny">Bu amal alohida tasdiq va parol talab qiladi.</p></section></div></main><%- include('partials/footer') %>
